<description>&lt;p&gt;Myanmar’s military has extended airstrikes across the Thai border, bombing a health centre in Tak province, striking homes and an IDP camp after an ASEAN envoy visit, and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, prompting a seven-day suspension of unofficial border trade. The junta’s attacks have killed civilians, including children, in Rakhine and Karenni states, while refugees are filling labor gaps in Thailand as Cambodian workers return home. The United States is linking its diplomatic engagement on Myanmar peace talks to access to the country’s rare-earth resources, and ASEAN is criticised for ineffective action on the crisis. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQektPMXRENjNVbGZYbW9uOE5TdHFnWkxqTWh0bmJqLWtFUnBMQ2xSM2s2am5ra3NLdEhBMFFhYTRYd29ENUx6eDI3YjBURW1BcW5jZ0RBSkowbEplM0lwY251UzZuWEZmZng0RGVvbkYxV090RTJlaVZvUkx5LWR1aFdfYWFTbmN2T05LbmRHOGhmOW5Cci1fSW96UjMxNDFuLThmMVo4V00teDd0a2Zr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNNzI1bktEZHRBVno0UVdnWktuRFZzRExKRkIwbkJ5TlRjZjNDYk9qTGtnaUtYMnJOY0hNUjA3ZGVFY3EyZ2NiQ2dtdHRBaFc1NnY1MGtVSWdyMHduanNoMXFXRHkwb1hqaUNLVmx5ODltRWVtVXdVdDVlb09FOHFyQTRTQ21HWkx6eUJpRE9FdmFzaUg1bzlwbW9pX2U2ZGh2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNd25lb1d3STE5REUxUURpLVpxcnM0UUswYVhZT3MwbENIb1l1WUtRMmt0ZHRmaVg1LXpmbVE1RE